  "result": "Done! Added complete customer statement functionality:\n\n**New module - src/statements.js:**\n\n`statement(customerId, invoices, asOf)` generates a customer statement showing all outstanding invoices.\n\n**Features:**\n\n1. **Filtering:**\n   - Only includes customer's invoices (by customerId)\n   - Only includes 'issued' or 'partially_paid' status\n   - Only includes invoices with issueDate on or before asOf date\n   - Excludes draft and fully paid invoices\n\n2. **Return format:**\n   ```javascript\n   {\n     customerId: 'C-001',\n     invoices: [\n       {\n         number: 'INV-2025-0001',\n         issueDate: '2025-10-15',\n         dueDate: '2025-11-14',\n         total: 102850,        // in cents\n         due: 50000            // remaining balance\n       },\n       // ... sorted by issueDate\n     ],\n     totalDue: 75000           // sum of all due amounts\n   }\n   ```\n\n3. **Sorting:**\n   - Invoices sorted by issueDate (earliest first)\n\n4. **Error handling:**\n   - Returns CUSTOMER_NOT_FOUND for unknown customers\n\n5. **Bug fixes:**\n   - Fixed `issueInvoice` to preserve `terms` and `dueDate`\n   - Fixed `recordPayment` to preserve all invoice fields including `terms`, `dueDate`, and `voucher`\n\n**Tests added:** 13 tests covering:\n- Empty statements\n- Status filtering (issues vs draft vs paid vs partially_paid)\n- Date cutoff filtering\n- Customer filtering (excluding other customers)\n- Sorting by issueDate\n- Total calculations\n- Due amount calculations from balanceDue\n- DueDate preservation\n- Unknown customer rejection\n\n**Test results:** \u2705 All 175 tests pass (162 existing + 13 new)",
